Stock Quantity Tracking

Feature Name

Stock Quantity Tracking

Short Description

This feature keeps track of the quantity of each inventory item available in the store. It records changes in stock whenever products are received, sold, or removed.

Purpose

The purpose of this feature is to maintain accurate information about the number of items available and help prevent stock shortages or incorrect inventory records.

Main Functions/Activities

- Record the current quantity of each inventory item.
- Increase stock quantities when new items are received.
- Decrease stock quantities when items are sold or removed.
- Display the available quantity for each SKU.
- Identify items that are running low.
- Keep inventory quantities updated and accurate.
